    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but they don't love me, they love the version of me that succeeded. if i stay, i'm just going to keep failing and failing and making things worse for everyone. wouldn't it be easier for them if i just... stopped being a burden? if i just stayed the person they remember instead of becoming this person who lets everyone down?",
